\taxon{Remark}
\title{Canonical commutation and Weyl operators}
\date{2026-11-13}

\p{The conjugate momentum is #{\Pi(z)=-\ui D_z}, and the Weyl
operators carry the same complex scalar. Mathematical physics writes
#{-iD_z}. The complex scalar is that commutation.}
